+## Eight owner decisions
+
+1. `thm-infinite-product-criterion` — **confirmed nonfatal**. Terra correctly
+   observes that `lem-of-abs-value` does not state the triangle inequality.
+   `lem-of-triangle-inequality` states verbatim
